{"suttaId":"thi-ap34","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[10199,10286],"vripara":"82"},"segments":{"thi-ap34:0.3":"Siṅgālamātutherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap34:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","thi-ap34:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","thi-ap34:2.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, jātāmaccakule ahuṃ;","thi-ap34:2.3":"Nānāratanapajjote, iddhe phīte mahaddhane.","thi-ap34:3.1":"“Pitunā saha gantvāna, mahājanapurakkhatā;","thi-ap34:3.3":"Dhammaṃ buddhassa sutvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thi-ap34:4.1":"“Pabbajitvāna kāyena, pāpakammaṃ vivajjayiṃ;","thi-ap34:4.3":"Vacīduccaritaṃ hitvā, ājīvaṃ parisodhayiṃ.","thi-ap34:5.1":"“Buddhe pasannā dhamme ca, saṅghe ca tibbagāravā;","thi-ap34:5.3":"Saddhammassavane yuttā, buddhadassanalālasā [buddhadassanasālayā (syā.)].","thi-ap34:6.1":"“Aggaṃ saddhādhimuttānaṃ, assosiṃ bhikkhuniṃ tadā;","thi-ap34:6.3":"Taṃ ṭhānaṃ patthayitvāna, tisso sikkhā apūrayiṃ.","thi-ap34:7.1":"“Tato maṃ sugato āha, karuṇānugatāsayo;","thi-ap34:7.3":"‘Yassa saddhā tathāgate, acalā suppatiṭṭhitā;","thi-ap34:7.5":"Sīlañca yassa kalyāṇaṃ, ariyakantaṃ pasaṃsitaṃ.","thi-ap34:8.1":"“‘Saṅghe pasādo yassatthi, ujubhūtañca dassanaṃ;","thi-ap34:8.3":"Adaliddoti taṃ āhu, amoghaṃ tassa jīvitaṃ.","thi-ap34:9.1":"“‘Tasmā saddhañca sīlañca, pasādaṃ dhammadassanaṃ;","thi-ap34:9.3":"Anuyuñjetha medhāvī, saraṃ buddhāna [buddhānusāsanaṃ (sī.), buddhānaṃ sāsanaṃ (syā.)] sāsanaṃ’.","thi-ap34:10.1":"“Taṃ sutvāhaṃ pamuditā, apucchiṃ paṇidhiṃ mama;","thi-ap34:10.3":"Tadā anomo amito, byākarittha vināyako;","thi-ap34:10.5":"‘Buddhe pasannā kalyāṇī, lacchase taṃ supatthitaṃ.","thi-ap34:11.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","thi-ap34:11.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","thi-ap34:12.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādā, orasā dhammanimmitā;","thi-ap34:12.3":"Siṅgālakassa [sigālakassa (sī. pī.)] mātāti, hessati satthu sāvikā’.","thi-ap34:13.1":"“Taṃ sutvā muditā hutvā, yāvajīvaṃ tadā jinaṃ;","thi-ap34:13.3":"Mettacittā paricariṃ, paṭipattīhi nāyakaṃ.","thi-ap34:14.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap34:14.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap34:15.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, giribbajapuruttame;","thi-ap34:15.3":"Jātā seṭṭhikule phīte, mahāratanasañcaye.","thi-ap34:16.1":"“Putto siṅgālako nāma, mamāsi vipathe rato;","thi-ap34:16.3":"Diṭṭhigahanapakkhando, disāpūjanatapparo.","thi-ap34:17.1":"“Nānādisā namassantaṃ [namassati (syā.)], piṇḍāya nagaraṃ vajaṃ;","thi-ap34:17.3":"Taṃ disvā ovadī buddho, magge ṭhatvā vināyako.","thi-ap34:18.1":"“Tassa desayato dhammaṃ, panādo vimhayo ahu;","thi-ap34:18.3":"Dvekoṭinaranārīnaṃ, dhammābhisamayo ahu.","thi-ap34:19.1":"“Tadāhaṃ parisaṃ gantvā, sutvā sugatabhāsitaṃ;","thi-ap34:19.3":"Sotāpattiphalaṃ pattā, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thi-ap34:20.1":"“Na cireneva kālena, buddhadassanalālasā;","thi-ap34:20.3":"Anussatiṃ taṃ bhāvetvā, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap34:21.1":"“Dassanatthāya buddhassa, sabbadā ca vajāmahaṃ;","thi-ap34:21.3":"Atittāyeva passāmi, rūpaṃ nayananandanaṃ.","thi-ap34:22.1":"“Sabbapāramisambhūtaṃ, lakkhīnilayanaṃ varaṃ;","thi-ap34:22.3":"Rūpaṃ sabbasubhākiṇṇaṃ, atittā viharāmahaṃ.","thi-ap34:23.1":"“Jino tasmiṃ guṇe tuṭṭho, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ;","thi-ap34:23.3":"Siṅgālakassa yā mātā, aggā saddhādhimuttikā [saṃghavimuttikā (pī.), mamādhimuttikā (ka.)].","thi-ap34:24.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap34:24.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homi mahāmuni.","thi-ap34:25.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap34:25.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap34:26.1":"“Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap34:26.3":"Ñāṇaṃ mama mahāvīra, uppannaṃ tava santike.","thi-ap34:27.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap34:28.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap34:29.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap34:30.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ siṅgālamātā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap34:31.1":"Siṅgālamātutheriyāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
